[Trigger]
Name	hunt
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Kingsfall, master, where Prince Aurel hunts and where he has made his stand. His champions are Falconer Edda, Huntsman Brann and Squire Wick, and a keeper who wants the crown must take them alive.
Action	objective	1	Capture or convert Falconer Edda, Huntsman Brann and Squire Wick. A champion who joins you is announced.
Action	objective	1	Defeat Prince Aurel and his court.
Action	objective	1	Keep an army of at least twelve creatures at your heart.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
